^Novice mage^ = ^学徒法师^
^Advanced mage^ = ^进阶法师^
^Expert mage^ = ^专家法师^
^Master mage^ = ^高阶法师^
^Archmage^ = ^大法师^
^MegaMage^ = ^传奇法师^
^Starting league^ = ^初级联赛^
^Advanced league^ = ^高级联赛^
^Major league^ = ^大师联赛^
^Fire creature^ = ^火系生物^
^cost^ = ^费用^
^Attack^ = ^攻击^
^life^ = ^生命^
^At the beginning of its owners turn,~Goblin Berserker deals 2 damage~to its neighboring creatures.^ = ^每当拥有者的回合开始阶段，【哥布林~狂战士】对邻格生物造成2点伤害。^
^When Wall of Fire is summoned~it deals 5 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures.^ = ^当【火墙】被召唤时，它会对对方所有~生物造成5点伤害。^
^Priest of Fire increases the growth~of its owner's Fire power by 1.^ = ^【火焰祭司】可使拥有者每回合的火系~能量成长率+1。^
^Fire Drake attacks the turn~it enters play.^ = ^【火迅龙】可以在上场的回合内就进行~攻击。^
^Orc Chieftan increases the attack~of its neighboring creatures by 2~(except walls).^ = ^【兽人酋长】可以使邻格生物的攻击+2~（墙类生物不会获得此加成）。^
^Fire spell^ = ^火系魔法^
^Flame Wave deals 9 damage to each~of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【火焰波浪】对对方所有生物造成9点~伤害。^
^Minotaur Commander increases by 1~the attack of all other owner's creatures~(except walls).^ = ^【牛头人指挥官】使己方所有其它生物~的攻击+1（墙类生物不会获得此加成）。^
^When Bargul is summoned it deals~4 damage to each other creature.^ = ^当【霸古魔】被召唤时，它对所有其它~生物造成4点伤害。^
^Inferno deals 18 damage to target~opponent's creature and 10 damage to~each of the opponent's other creatures.^ = ^【炼狱爆轰】对对方目标生物造成18点~伤害，并对对方所有其它生物造成10点~伤害。^
^attack is equal~to its owner's Fire power, life^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~的火系能量，生命^
^When Fire Elemental is summoned~it deals 3 damage to the opponent~and to each of the opponent's creatures.~Fire Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Fire power by 1.^ = ^当【火元素】被召唤时，对对方本体和~对方所有生物造成3点伤害。【火元素】~使拥有者的火系能量成长率+1。^
^Armageddon deals~(8 + its caster's Fire power) damage~to the opponent and to each creature.^ = ^【末日审判】会对所有生物和对方本体~造成（8+施法者火系能量）点伤害。^
^Dragon increases the damage~its owner's spells deal by 50%~(total damage will be rounded up).^ = ^【火龙】使拥有者施放的魔法所造成的~伤害增加50%（数值向上取整）。^
^Water spell^ = ^水系魔法^
^Meditation increases its caster's~Fire, Air and Earth powers by 1.^ = ^【冥想】使拥有者的火系、气系和土系~能量各+1。^
^Water creature^ = ^水系生物^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Sea Sprite deals 2 damage to its owner.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【海妖】对~拥有者本体造成2点伤害。^
^When Merfolk Apostate is summoned~it increases its owner's Fire power by 2.^ = ^当【人鱼变节者】被召唤时，它可以使~拥有者的火系能量+2。^
^Ice Golem receives no damage~from spells and abilites.^ = ^【寒冰傀儡】不会受到任何魔法或技能~所造成的伤害。^
^Merfolk Elder increases the growth~of its owner's Air power by 1.^ = ^【人鱼长老】可使拥有者每回合的气系~能量成长率+1。^
^Ice Guard reduces all damage~dealt to its owner by 50%~(total damage will be rounded up).^ = ^【冰霜守卫】使拥有者本体受到的任何~伤害减少50%（数值向上取整）。^
^Damage dealt to Giant Turtle~is reduced by 5.^ = ^【巨龟】所受到的任何伤害均-5。^
^Acidic Rain deals 15 damage to each~creature, then decreases each~of the opponent's powers by 1.^ = ^【酸雨术】对所有生物造成15点伤害，~然后使对方的各系能量-1。^
^Merfolk Overlord allows creatures~in its neighboring slots to attack~the turn they enter play.^ = ^【人鱼领主】使邻格生物可以在上场的~回合内就进行攻击。^
^attack is equal~to its owner's Water power, life^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~的水系能量，生命^
^When Water Elemental is summoned~it heals 10 life to its owner.~Water Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Water power by 1.^ = ^【水元素】被召唤时，它使拥有者本体~回复10点生命。【水元素】使拥有者的~水系能量成长率+1。^
^Mind Master increases the growth~of each of its owner's powers by 1.^ = ^【心灵大师】可使拥有者每回合的各系~能量成长率+1。^
^Astral Guard decreases the growth~of each of the opponent's powers by 1.^ = ^【星魂守卫】使对方每回合的各系能量~成长率-1。^
^Air creature^ = ^气系生物^
^Faerie Apprentice increases the damage~its owner's spells deal by 1.^ = ^【仙灵学徒】可以使拥有者施放的魔法~所造成的伤害+1。^
^When Griffin is summoned,~if its owner's Air power is 5 or more,~it deals 5 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【狮鹫】被召唤时，如果拥有者的气系~能量不少于5，它会对对方本体造成5点~伤害。^
^Air spell^ = ^气系魔法^
^Call to Thunder deals 6 damage~to target opponent's creature~and 6 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【落雷术】对对方目标生物和对方本体~造成6点伤害。^
^When Faerie Sage is summoned~it heals an amount of life to its owner~equal to its owner's Earth power,~but not more than 10.^ = ^当【仙灵贤者】被召唤时，它使拥有者~本体回复等同于拥有者土系能量的生命~（数值不超过10）。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Wall of Lightning deals 4 damage~to the opponent.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【闪电之墙】~对对方本体造成4点伤害。^
^Lightning Bolt deals~(5+its caster's Air power) damage~to the opponent.^ = ^【雷神之箭】可以对对方本体造成（5+~施法者气系能量）点伤害。^
^Each time Phoenix dies, if its owner's~Fire power is 10 or greater, it rebirths~(another Phoenix is put into the same slot).~Phoenix cannot rebirth if a card~says that it is "destroyed".^ = ^【凤凰】死亡时，若拥有者的火系能量~不少于10，它会重生（新的【凤凰】会~放置在同一格里）。若【凤凰】被一张~卡牌“摧毁”，则它不会重生。^
^Chain Lightning deals 9 damage~to the opponent and to each~of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【连锁闪电】会对对方本体和对方所有~生物造成9点伤害。^
^Lightning Cloud's attack damages~the opponent and each of~the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【雷电云】的攻击会对对方本体和对方~所有生物造成伤害。^
^Destroy target opponent's creature.^ = ^【龙卷风】可以摧毁对方的目标生物。^
^attack is equal~to its owner's Air power, life^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~的气系能量，生命^
^When Air Elemental is summoned~it deals 8 damage to the opponent.~Air Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Air power by 1.^ = ^当【气元素】被召唤时，它对对方本体~造成8点伤害。【气元素】使拥有者的~气系能量成长率+1。^
^When Titan is summoned~it deals 15 damage to the creature~in the opposing slot.^ = ^当【泰坦巨人】被召唤时，它会对对格~生物造成15点伤害。^
^Earth creature^ = ^土系生物^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Elvish Healer heals 3 life to its owner.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【精灵医者】~使拥有者本体回复3点生命。^
^Earth spell^ = ^土系魔法^
^Nature's Ritual heals 8 life~to target caster's creature~and to its caster.^ = ^【自然仪式】使己方目标生物和施法者~本体各回复8点生命。^
^Forest Sprite's attack damages~the opponent and each of~the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【森林仙子】的攻击可以对对方本体和~对方所有生物造成伤害。^
^Rejuvenation heals an amount of life~to its caster equal to twice~its caster's Earth power.^ = ^【活力恢复】使施法者本体回复等同于~土系能量×2的生命。^
^Elf Hermit increases the growth~of its owner's Earth power by 2.^ = ^【精灵隐士】可使拥有者每回合的土系~能量成长率+2。^
^Nature's Fury deals an amount of damage~to the opponent equal to the total~attack of its caster's two creatures~with the highest attack.^ = ^【自然之怒】可以对对方本体造成X点~伤害。X为施法者攻击最高的两个生物的~攻击之和。^
^When Giant Spider is summoned,~it puts a 2/11 Forest Spider into~each of its empty neighboring slots.^ = ^【巨型蜘蛛】被召唤时，它在相邻空格~放置数值为2/11的【丛林蜘蛛】。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Troll heals 4 life to itself.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【巨魔】回复~4点生命。^
^Stone Rain deals 25 damage~to each creature.^ = ^【石雨术】对所有生物造成25点伤害。^
^attack is equal~to its owner's Earth power^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~的土系能量^
^Earth Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Earth power by 1.^ = ^【土元素】使拥有者每回合的土系能量~成长率+1。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Master Healer heals 3 life to its owner~and to each of its owner's creatures.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【医疗大师】~可以使拥有者本体和己方所有生物回复~3点生命。^
^Hydra's attack damages the opponent~and each of the opponent's creatures.~At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Hydra heals 4 life to itself.^ = ^【九头蛇】的攻击会对对方本体和对方~的所有生物造成伤害。在拥有者的回合~开始阶段，【九头蛇】回复4点生命。^
^Death spell^ = ^死亡系魔法^
^Dark Ritual deals 3 damage~to the opponent's creatures,~then heals 3 life to each~of its caster's creatures.^ = ^【黑暗仪式】会对对方的所有生物造成~3点伤害，然后使己方的所有生物回复~3点生命。^
^Cursed Fog deals 12 damage to each~creature and 3 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【诅咒之雾】可以对所有生物造成12点~伤害，并对对方本体造成3点伤害。^
^Death creature^ = ^死亡系生物^
^When Banshee is summoned~it deals damage to the creature~in the opposing slot~equal to half of that creature's life~(rounded up).^ = ^当【哀嚎女妖】被召唤时，它会对对格~生物造成等同于该对格生物当前生命~50%的伤害（数值向上取整）。^
^Emissary of Dorlak must be summoned~onto another of its owner's creatures.~That creature is destroyed.^ = ^【铎拉克使者】必须在拥有者一个场上~生物上召唤。此生物被摧毁。^
^Destroy target caster's creature.~Blood Ritual deals X damage to each of~the opponent's creatures, where X~is equal to the life of the destroyed~creature, but not more than 32.^ = ^【血祭仪式】摧毁己方目标生物，然后~对对方所有生物造成X点伤害。其中X为~被摧毁生物的生命（数值不超过32）。^
^Each time an opponent's creature dies~Keeper of Death increases its owner's~Death power by 1.^ = ^当对方任一生物死亡时，【亡灵御守】~使拥有者的死亡系能量+1。^
^Kill all creatures. Drain Souls heals~an amount of life to its caster equal to~twice the number of creatures killed by~this spell. When Drain Souls is cast it is~replaced by the Rage of Souls spell card.^ = ^【灵魂汲取】会杀死所有生物，然后使~施法者回复等同于此魔法杀死生物数量~×2的生命。之后此【灵魂汲取】卡牌~被【灵魂狂怒】替代。^
^When Master Lich is summoned it deals 8~damage to each of the opponent's creatures.~Each time Master Lich deals damage~to the opponent, it increases~its owner's Death power by 2.^ = ^当【巫妖王】被召唤时，它对对方所有~生物造成8点伤害。【巫妖王】对对方~本体造成伤害时，它使拥有者的死亡系~能量+2。^
^Holy creature^ = ^神圣系（圣灵系）生物^
^When Paladin is summoned it heals~4 life to each of its owner's creatures.^ = ^当【圣骑士】被召唤时，它使己方所有~生物回复4点生命。^
^When Monk dies it increases~its owner's Holy power by 2.^ = ^【僧侣】死亡时，它使拥有者的神圣系~能量+2。^
^Holy Guard decreases all damage dealt~to its neighboring creatures by 2.^ = ^【神圣护卫】可使邻格生物受到的任何~伤害-2。^
^Holy spell^ = ^神圣系（圣灵系）魔法^
^Divine Justice heals 12 life~to target caster's creature and~deals 12 damage to each other creature.^ = ^【神圣审判】使己方目标生物回复12点~生命，对所有其它生物造成12点伤害。^
^Divine Intervention increases its caster's~Fire, Water, Air and Earth powers by 2,~then heals 10 life to its caster.^ = ^【神圣干预】使施法者的火系、水系、~气系和土系能量各+2，并使施法者本体~回复10点生命。^
^Wrath of God deals 12 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures, then increases~its caster's Holy power by 1 for each of~the opponent's creatures that did not die.^ = ^【神之裁决】对对方所有生物造成12点~伤害，然后使施法者的神圣系能量+X。~其中X为此魔法未杀死的对方生物数量。^
^When Angel is summoned it increases~its owner's Holy power by 3.^ = ^当【天使】被召唤时，它可使拥有者的~神圣系能量或圣灵系能量+3。^
^When Archangel is summoned~it completely heals each~of its owner's creatures.^ = ^当【大天使】被召唤时，它使己方所有~生物回复至满生命。^
^Mechanical spell^ = ^机械系魔法^
^Overtime increases its caster's~Mechanics power by 1.^ = ^【赶制】使施法者的机械系能量+1。^
^Mechanical creature^ = ^机械系生物^
^Each time the opponent summons~a creature Dwarven Rifleman deals~4 damage to that creature.^ = ^当对方召唤生物时，【矮人火枪手】对~此生物造成4点伤害。^
^Dwarven Craftsman increases the growth~of its owner's Mechanics power by 1.^ = ^【矮人工匠】使拥有者的机械系能量~成长率+1。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Ornithopter deals 2 damage to~each of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【扑翼飞机】~对对方所有生物造成2点伤害。^
^Steel Golem receives no damage from~spells and abilities. Damage dealt~to Steel Golem is reduced by 1.^ = ^【钢铁傀儡】不会受到任何魔法或技能~所造成的伤害。【钢铁傀儡】所受到的~任何伤害均-1。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Cannon deals 8 damage to the opponent's~creature with the most life.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【加农炮】~对对方生命最高的生物造成8点伤害。^
^Cannonade deals 19 damage~to each of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【列炮齐发】对对方所有生物造成19点~伤害。^
^When Steam Tank is summoned~it deals 12 damage to each~of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^当【蒸汽坦克】被召唤时，它会对对方~所有生物造成12点伤害。^
^Illusion spell^ = ^幻像系魔法^
^Madness deals damage to each~of the opponent's creatures equal~to the attack of that creature.^ = ^【入狂幻术】对对方的每一个生物造成~等同于此生物攻击的伤害。^
^Illusion creature^ = ^幻像系生物^
^Damage dealt to Phantom Warrior~is reduced to 1.^ = ^【幻像勇士】所受到的任何伤害均可以~被减至1。^
^The two opponent's creatures with~the highest attack immediately~attack the opponent.^ = ^【催眠术】使对方攻击最高的两个生物~立即攻击对方本体。^
^Each time Wall of Reflection receives~damage it deals an equal amount~of damage to the opponent, but not more~than the life lost by Wall of Reflection.^ = ^当【反射之墙】受到任何伤害时，它对~对方本体造成等量的伤害（但不会超过~【反射之墙】损失的生命）。^
^When Spectral Assassin is summoned~it deals 12 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【幽幻刺客】被召唤时，它对对方本体~造成12点伤害。^
^When Spectral Mage is summoned it deals~damage to each of the opponent's creatures~equal to the cost of that creature.^ = ^【幽幻法师】被召唤时，它对对方每个~生物造成等同于此生物费用的伤害。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Oracle deals damage to the opponent~equal to its owner's Illusion power.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【神谕使者】~会对对方本体造成等同于拥有者幻像系~能量的伤害。^
^When Hypnotist is summoned it deals~5 damage to the opponent and to each~of the opponent's creatures.~Hypnotist increases the growth~of its owner's Illusion power by 1.^ = ^【催眠大师】被召唤时，它对对方本体~和对方所有生物造成5点伤害。【催眠~大师】使得拥有者每回合的幻像系能量~成长率+1。^
^Control creature^ = ^控制系生物^
^Goblin Shaman increases the cost~of all of the opponent's spells by 1.^ = ^【哥布林萨满】使对方所有魔法卡牌的~费用+1。^
^Control spell^ = ^控制系魔法^
^Weakness decreases each of~the opponent's powers by 1,~then deals 3 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【虚弱】使对方的各系能量-1，然后对~对方本体造成3点伤害。^
^Damping Tower increases the cost~of all of the opponent's cards by 1.^ = ^【阻尼塔】使对方所有卡牌的费用+1。^
^During the opponent's attack, each of~their creatures with cost less than~Ancient Horror's owner's Control power~skip their attack.^ = ^在对方的生物攻击阶段，【远古惧像】~使得所有费用低于X的生物跳过其攻击~阶段。其中X为【远古惧像】拥有者的~控制系能量。^
^Poisonous Cloud decreases all of~the opponent's powers by 1,~then deals damage to each of~the opponent's creatures equal to~half of its life (rounded up).^ = ^【剧毒之云】使对方的各系能量-1，并~对对方的每一个生物造成等同于此生物~50%生命的伤害（数值向上取整）。^
^When Ancient Witch is summoned,~it decreases each of the opponent's~powers by 2.^ = ^当【远古女巫】被召唤时，它使对方的~各系能量-2。^
^Each time a creature in the opposing slot~performs its attack, it deals damage~to itself instead of Mindstealer.^ = ^当【窃心魔】的对格生物进行攻击时，~此生物只对自身造成伤害。^
^When Ancient Giant is summoned~it forces opponent to skip their next turn.^ = ^【远古巨人】被召唤时，它使对方失去~下一个出牌阶段。^
^Chaos creature^ = ^混沌系生物^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Insanian Peacekeeper heals 1-6 life~to its owner.^ = ^每次在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【混沌~维和者】使拥有者本体回复1-6点生命。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Insanian Berseker deals 1-6 damage~to the opponent.^ = ^每次在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【混沌~狂战士】对对方本体造成1-6点伤害。^
^Chaos spell^ = ^混沌系魔法^
^Doom Bolt deals 25 damage to~a random opponent's creature.^ = ^【混沌死棘】对对方随机一个生物造成~25点伤害。^
^Chaotic Wave deals 2-12 damage to each~of the opponent's creatures, then heals~2-12 life to each of its caster's creatures.^ = ^【混沌波浪】对对方的每一个生物造成~2-12点伤害，并使己方每一个生物回复~2-12点生命。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Insanian Shaman decreases a random~opponent's power by 2.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【混沌萨满】~使对方随机一个系的能量-2。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Insanian Lord increases a random~owner's power by 2.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【混沌领主】~使拥有者随机一个系的能量+2。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Insanian Catapult deals 10 damage~to a random opponent's creature.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【混沌石砲】~对对方随机一个生物造成10点伤害。^
^At the end of its owner's turn,~Insanian King puts a 4/15 Soldier~into a random empty slot.^ = ^拥有者的回合结束阶段，【混沌君王】~在随机一空格处放置一个数值为4/15的~【混沌卫兵】。^
^Special creature^ = ^特殊生物^
^When life of Sleeping Giant~drops to 30 or less it wakes up and~becomes 14/55 Raging Giant creature.^ = ^当【沉睡巨人】的生命降至30或更低的~时候，它醒来并转化成数值为14/55的~【狂暴巨人】。^
^Raging Giant regenerates 10 life~to itself each turn.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【狂暴巨人】~回复10点生命。^
^When any of owner's powers becomes 12~or higher Cloistered Elemental is released~and becomes a Supreme Elemental.^ = ^拥有者任一系的能量达到12或更高时，~【禁锢元素】将会被释放，同时转化成~【至尊元素】。^
^Cost^ = ^费用^
^Attack is equal to highest owner power^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~各系能量中的最高值^
^Life:^ = ^生命^
^Mad Cat of Alrio deal 4 damage~to its owner's other creatures each turn.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【艾瑞欧的~疯猫】对己方的所有其它生物造成4点~伤害。^
^Volcano is immune to spells.~Volcano deals 5 damage to neighboring~creatures each turn.^ = ^【火山】对魔法免疫。在拥有者的回合~开始阶段，【火山】会对邻格生物造成~5点伤害。^
^If there is a creature in the opposing slot~the Vampire receives +4 to attack~Each time Vampire deals damage~to a creature it heals an equal~amount of life to itself.^ = ^若对格有生物，【吸血鬼】的攻击+4。~【吸血鬼】对生物造成伤害时，它回复~等量的生命。^
^Altar of Sacrifice is immune to spells.~Owner can summon creatures~onto Altar of Sacrifice~The summoned creature is sacrificed and~owner receives an amount of power~equal to twice the creature's cost.^ = ^【牺牲祭坛】对魔法免疫。拥有者可以~在【牺牲祭坛】上召唤生物。所召唤的~生物被牺牲，拥有者获得等同于此生物~费用×2的同系能量。^
^attack is equal to~the number of opponent's creatures^ = ^攻击等于对方~生物数量^
^Each Air Spirit's attack damages opponent~and each of opponent's creatures.^ = ^【气灵】的攻击可以对对方本体和对方~所有生物造成伤害。^
^Everraining Land is immune to spells.~Everraining Land increases the cost~of all cards by 2 for both players.~Each time any player skips a turn~Everraining Land deals 5 damage to him.^ = ^【永雨之地】对所有魔法免疫。【永雨~之地】使双方所有卡牌费用+2。当任一~玩家跳轮时，【永雨之地】对此玩家的~本体造成5点伤害。^
^attack is equal~to owner's lowest power^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~各系能量中的最低值^
^life:^ = ^生命^
^Each turn Astral Drake~regenerates 4 life to itself.~Astral Drake's attack damages opponent~and each of opponent's creatures.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【星魂亚龙】~回复4点生命。【星魂亚龙】的攻击可~对对方本体和对方所有生物造成伤害。^
^Academy of Magic is immune to spells.~Each time owner casts a spell~Academy of Magic summons an~Adept of Magic (4/12 creature)~to a random empty slot.^ = ^【魔法学院】对魔法免疫。每当拥有者~施放魔法时，【魔法学院】在随机空格~放置一个数值为4/12的【魔法专家】。^
^When Jade Statue is destroyed~it deals 25 damage to each creature.^ = ^当【翡翠雕像】死亡时，它对所有生物~造成25点伤害。^
^Nettling Faerie moves to a random empty~slot at the end of owner's turn.^ = ^拥有者的回合结束阶段，【淘气仙子】~移动到随机空格处。^
^Merfolk Revolutionary increases the growth~of owner's Water power by 1 and reduces~the growth of opponent's Water power by 1.~Each turn Merfolk Revolutionary~moves to the player with lower life.^ = ^【人鱼革命家】使得拥有者的水系能量~成长率+1，并使对方的水系能量成长率~-1。在拥有者的回合结束阶段，【人鱼~革命家】转移到生命较低的玩家一方。^
^When Ambrosia Stone is destroyed~opponent receives 20 life.^ = ^当【长生石】被摧毁时，它使对方本体~回复20点生命。^
^Phoenix Hydra's attack damages opponent~and each of opponent's creatures.~Each time Phoenix Hydra dies it reborn~and its attack permanently increases by 1.^ = ^【凤翼九头蛇】的攻击会对对方本体和~对方的所有生物造成伤害。每当【凤翼~九头蛇】死亡，它重生且攻击永久+1。^
^Baffler Roost is immune to spells.~Baffler Roost doubles the cost~of all cards for both players.^ = ^【抑魔处所】对所有魔法免疫。【抑魔~处所】使双方所有卡牌的费用×2。^
^Marching Stone is immune to spells.~Marching Stone moves one slot to~the right each turn, swapping positions~with any creature in that slot.^ = ^【行军石】对魔法免疫。在拥有者回合~结束阶段，【行军石】移动到它右边的~格子（如果右边的格子有生物，则与其~交换位置）。^
^Peace Tree reduces attack~of opponent's creatures by 1.^ = ^【和平之树】使对方所有生物攻击-1。^
^Tamed creature^ = ^驯化的生物^
^When pet is resummoned it deals 6 damage~to creature in the opposite slot.^ = ^每当狮鹫被重新召唤时，它对对格生物~造成6点伤害。^
^When pet's ability is used~it completely regenerates.^ = ^使用狮鹫技能时，狮鹫回复至满生命。^
^Pet's ability^ = ^狮鹫技能^
^Pet moves to target empty slot~and pet's attack is increased~by 3 until end of turn.^ = ^狮鹫移动到目标空格，攻击+3。此加成~在回合结束时消失。^
^Fetid Swamp is immune to spells.~Fetid Swamp deals 2 damage~to each creature each turn.^ = ^【恶臭沼泽】对魔法免疫。在拥有者的~回合开始阶段，【恶臭沼泽】会对所有~生物造成2点伤害。^
^Wandering Stone is immune to spells.~Wandering stone moves to~a random slot each turn, swapping~positions with any creature in that slot.^ = ^【漫步石】对魔法免疫。拥有者的回合~结束阶段，【漫步石】移动到另一随机~格子（如果此格有生物，则会与其交换~位置）。^
^Immune to spells.~When owner casts a creature onto~the altar, all creatures in play of that~power type are sacrificed, and their~power cost is returned to their owner.^ = ^【反召唤祭坛】对魔法免疫。当拥有者~在此祭坛上召唤生物时，与此生物同系~的每一个场上生物被牺牲，同时其费用~返回到各自的拥有者手中。^
^Great Oak summons Forest Sprite each turn~into a random empty slot.^ = ^在拥有者回合开始阶段，【巨型橡树】~在随机空格处放置一个【森林仙子】。^
^Temple of Fire summons Priest of Fire~each turn into a random empty slot.^ = ^在拥有者回合开始阶段，【火焰神殿】~在随机空格处放置一个【火焰祭司】。^
^Astral Accelerator gives to owner~2 power of random type each time owner~uses a card of cost 4 or less.^ = ^当拥有者施放魔法时，【星魂加速器】~使拥有者随机一个系的能量+2。^
^Meatgrinder does no damage to players.^ = ^【绞肉机】无法对玩家造成伤害。^
^Hallowed Ground is immune to spells.~Whenever owner's creature dies~Hallowed Ground heals all~owner's creatures and owner~by the attack of the dying creature.^ = ^【神佑之地】对魔法免疫。拥有者生物~死亡时，【神佑之地】使拥有者和己方~所有生物回复等同于此死亡生物攻击的~生命。^
^Mine is invisible.~When Mine is damaged by a creature~the creature suffers 12 damage~and the Mine is destroyed.^ = ^【地雷】对玩家不可见。【地雷】受到~来源于生物的伤害时，此生物受到12点~伤害，同时【地雷】被摧毁。^
^When opponent plays a card they lose~all remaining power of the type spent.^ = ^当对方使用一张卡牌时，他失去与此牌~同系的所有剩余能量。^
^Inactive Hellbot is immune to spells.~Can be activated for a cost~of 4 Mechanical power.^ = ^【未激活的终极机械】对魔法免疫。用~4点机械系能量可以激活它。^
^Attacks 3 slots - the opposing~slot and its two neighbors.~This means if completely unblocked,~it deals triple damage to opponent.^ = ^【终极机械】攻击3个格子——对格和~对格的邻格。这也意味着如果3个格子~都未被阻挡，【终极机械】对对方本体~造成3倍的伤害。^
^When Starfish dies~it spawns two 4/8 starfish.^ = ^当【海星】死亡时，它产生两个数值为~4/8的【海星】。^
^When Starfish dies~it spawns two 2/4 starfish.^ = ^当【海星】死亡时，它产生两个数值为~2/4的【海星】。^
^When Starfish dies~it spawns two 1/2 starfish.^ = ^当【海星】死亡时，它产生两个数值为~1/2的【海星】。^
^All spells cost twice as much~for both players.^ = ^双方所有魔法的费用翻倍。^
^ attack is~equal to sum of owner's powers^ = ^ 攻击等于拥有者~各系能量之和^
^Megacolossus reduces the growth~of owner's Air power by 1.^ = ^【超级巨像】可以使拥有者的气系能量~成长率-1。^
^Cursed Ground is immune to spells.~When any creature dies all creatures in play~are dealt damage equal to its power.^ = ^【诅咒之地】对魔法免疫。当任一生物~死亡时，场上所有的生物会受到等同于~其攻击的伤害。^
^Immune to spells. Owner can summon~creatures onto Spectral Altar.~Owner gains an amount of power~equal to the creature's cost~in each of two random powers.^ = ^【星魂祭坛】对魔法免疫。拥有者对其~进行召唤生物时，拥有者的随机两个系~获得等同于此生物费用的能量。^
^Each turn owner's special~power cards are replaced with~a random discipline's cards.^ = ^每回合拥有者的特殊系卡牌会被替换成~随机一系的卡牌。^
^Celestia allows all allied creatures to~attack the turn they are summoned.^ = ^【瑟莱蒂娅】使得己方的所有生物在其~被召唤的回合内就可以进行攻击。^
^Council of Liches can't be defeated~while Soul Jar is in play.^ = ^【灵魂匣】在场时，【巫妖议会】无法~被击败。^
^Deals (9 + caster's Death power) damage~to each of opponent's creatures.~Caster gains 2 life for each~creature killed by this spell.^ = ^【灵魂狂怒】对对方所有生物造成（9+~死亡系能量）点的伤害，并会使施法者~回复等同于此魔法杀死生物数量×2的~生命。^
^Demonic creature^ = ^恶魔系生物^
^When Lemure dies it is replaced~by a 3/6 Scrambled Lemure.^ = ^当【劣魔】死亡时，在其原位放置一个~数值为3/6的【惊恐劣魔】。^
^Demonic spell^ = ^恶魔系魔法^
^Destroy target caster's creature.~Explosion deals 28 damage to~the creature in the opposing slot.^ = ^【自爆】摧毁己方目标生物，并对对格~生物造成28点伤害。^
^Power Chains deals 12 damage to~target opponent's Fire, Water, Air or~Earth Creature, then decreases~that opponent's power by 3.^ = ^【能量锁链】对对方火系、水系、气系~或土系的目标生物造成12点伤害，然后~使对方的此系能量-3。^
^When Ergodemon dies, it decreases~each of the opponent's powers by 1.^ = ^【恶果魔】死亡时，对方各系能量-1。^
^Demon Quartermaster increases the growth~of its owner's Demonic power by 1.~When Demon Quartermaster dies it is~replaced by a 6/20 Enraged Quartermaster.^ = ^【恶魔军需官】使拥有者的恶魔系能量~成长率+1。当【恶魔军需官】死亡时，~在其原位放置一个数值为6/20的【暴怒~军需官】。^
^Hellfire deals 13 damage to each~of the opponent's creatures, then~increases its caster's Fire power by 1~for each creature killed by this spell.^ = ^【地狱烈焰】对对方所有生物造成13点~伤害，然后使得施法者的火系能量+X。~其中X为此魔法杀死的对方生物数量。^
^Three-headed Demon's attack damages~the opponent and each of the opponent's~creatures. When Three-headed Demon dies~it is replaced by a 2/25 Demon Apostate.^ = ^【三首恶魔】的攻击可以对对方本体和~对方所有生物造成伤害。【三首恶魔】~死亡时在其原位放置一个数值为2/25的~【恶魔变节者】。^
^When Greater Demon is summoned it deals~an amount of damage to the opponent~and to each of the opponent's creatures~equal to its owner's Fire power,~but not more than 10.^ = ^当【大恶魔】被召唤时，它对对方本体~和对方所有生物造成X点伤害。其中X为~拥有者的火系能量，但不超过10。^
^Sorcery spell^ = ^巫术系魔法^
^Healing Spray heals 9 life to target~caster's creature and 6 life~to its neighboring creatures.^ = ^【雾疗术】使得己方目标生物回复9点~生命，并使其邻格生物回复6点生命。^
^Fireball deals 9 damage to target~opponent's creature and 6 damage~to its neighboring creatures.^ = ^【火球术】会对对方目标生物造成9点~伤害，并对其邻格生物造成6点伤害。^
^Steal Essence deals 5 damage to~target creature. If the creature~is killed by this spell, its caster's~Sorcery power is increased by 4.^ = ^【精华汲取】可以对目标生物造成5点~伤害。若此魔法杀死目标生物，施法者~的巫术系能量+4。^
^Destroy target caster's creature.~Sacrifice increases its caster's Fire,~Water, Air and Earth powers by 3.^ = ^【牺牲献祭】摧毁己方目标生物，并使~施法者的火系、水系、气系和土系能量~各+3。^
^Ritual of Glory completely heals~each of its caster's creatures,~then increases their attack by 3~until end of turn (except walls).^ = ^【光荣仪式】可使己方所有生物回复至~满生命，并使它们的攻击+3（墙类生物~不会获得此加成）。此攻击加成在回合~结束时消失。^
^Mana Burn deals an amount of damage~to each of the opponent's creatures~equal to the opponent's highest power type,~then decreases that opponent's power by 3.^ = ^【法力燃烧】可以对对方所有生物造成~等同于对方各个系中最高能量的伤害，~并且使对方的此系能量-3。^
^Sonic Boom deals 11 damage to~the opponent and to each of~the opponent's creatures. Those~creatures skip their attack next turn.^ = ^【音爆】可以对对方本体和对方的所有~生物造成11点伤害，并使这些生物跳过~下回合的攻击阶段。^
^Destroy target opponent's creature.~Disintegrate deals 11 damage to each~of the opponent's other creatures.^ = ^【裂解】可以摧毁对方目标生物，并且~对对方其它生物造成11点伤害。^
^Beast^ = ^野兽^
^attack^ = ^攻击^
^When Magic Hamster is summoned it heals~10 life to each of its neighboring creatures.^ = ^【魔法仓鼠】被召唤时，它使邻格生物~回复10点生命。^
^Activated ability^ = ^主动技能^
^Magic Hamster heals 18 life to all~of its owner's creatures.^ = ^【魔法仓鼠】使己方所有生物回复18点~生命。^
^When Scorpion is summoned it causes~the creature in the opposing slot~to skip its attack next turn.^ = ^【毒蝎】被召唤时，它使对格生物跳过~下回合的攻击阶段。^
^Scorpion deals 14 damage~to target opponent's creature.^ = ^【毒蝎】可以对对方目标生物造成14点~伤害。^
^Wolverine completely heals itself and~its attack is increased by 2 permanently.^ = ^【狼獾】回复至满生命，攻击永久+2。^
^Energy Beast increases its owner's Fire,~Water, Air and Earth powers by 1.^ = ^【魔能兽】可使拥有者的火系、水系、~气系和土系能量各+1。^
^Death Falcon moves to target empty slot~and deals 4 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【死亡之隼】移动到目标空格处，并且~对对方所有生物造成4点伤害。^
^All damage that would be dealt to its~owner is dealt to White Elephant instead.^ = ^将要对拥有者所造成的所有伤害都重新~定向至【白象】。^
^White Elephant increases~its owner's Beast power by 1.^ = ^【白象】使拥有者的野兽系能量+1。^
^At the end of its owner's turn Basilisk~deals 4 damage to each of the opponent's~creatures with 8 or less life.^ = ^在拥有者的回合结束阶段，【巨蜥】可~对对方所有生命不超过8的生物造成4点~伤害。^
^Deals 6 damage to target creature.^ = ^【巨蜥】可以对对方目标生物造成6点~伤害。^
^When Ancient Dragon is summoned it~increases each of its owner's powers by 1.^ = ^【远古巨龙】被召唤时，它使拥有者的~各系能量+1。^
^Ancient Dragon deals 10 damage~to the opponent and to each of~the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【远古巨龙】可以对对方本体和对方的~所有生物造成10点伤害。^
^Hamster's ability^ = ^魔法仓鼠的主动技能^
^Magic Hamster heals 18 life~to all owner's creatures.^ = ^【魔法仓鼠】使己方所有生物回复18点~生命。^
^Scorpions's ability^ = ^【毒蝎】的主动技能^
^Scorpion deals 14 damage~to target creature.^ = ^【毒蝎】可以对对方目标生物造成14点~伤害。^
^Wolverine's ability^ = ^【狼獾】的主动技能^
^Wolverine heals all damage and~its attack is increased~by 2 permanently.^ = ^【狼獾】回复至满生命，攻击永久+2。^
^Energy Beast's ability^ = ^【魔能兽】的主动技能^
^Falcon's ability^ = ^【死亡之隼】的主动技能^
^Elephant's ability^ = ^【白象】的主动技能^
^Basilisk's ability^ = ^【巨蜥】的主动技能^
^Dragon's ability^ = ^【远古巨龙】的主动技能^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn~Demon Apostate heals 2 life to its owner~and to each of its owner's creatures.^ = ^拥有者回合开始阶段，【恶魔变节者】~使拥有者本体和己方所有生物回复2点~生命。^
^Each time owner uses a card~of his specialty power type,~his elemental power amounts~are redistributed randomly.^ = ^每当拥有者使用一张特殊系的卡牌时，~其基础系的能量随机地重新分配。^
^Each time owner uses an Air card,~Living Tornado moves to random slot~and its attack permanently increases by 1.^ = ^当拥有者使用一张气系卡牌时，【活性~龙卷风】移到随机格子，攻击永久+1。^
^Each turn Niggling Imp moves~to a random slot.~While Niggling imp remains in play~owner can't use Demonic cards.^ = ^每当在拥有者的回合结束阶段，【淘气~小恶魔】移动到随机格子。每当【淘气~小恶魔】在场时，其拥有者不能够使用~恶魔系卡牌。^
^Each time Vampiric Cloud attacks~its attack increases by 1~and its life by 2 permanently.^ = ^每当【吸血蝙蝠群】攻击时，它的攻击~永久+1，生命及其上限永久+2。^
^Sorceror's Apprentice increases the growth~of owner's Sorcery power by 2.^ = ^【巫师学徒】使得拥有者的巫术系能量~成长率+2。^
^Life^ = ^生命^
^Solid Echo dies after its attack.^ = ^【回音实体】在其攻击后死亡。^
^Each turn Beehive stuns the opponent's~creature with the highest life.^ = ^【蜂巢】每回合使对方生命最高的生物~跳过下回合的攻击阶段。^
^Dark Troll decreases the growth~of owner's Earth power by 1.~Dark Troll regererates 3 life~to itself each turn.^ = ^【黑暗巨魔】可以使拥有者的土系能量~成长率-1。在拥有者的回合开始阶段，~【黑暗巨魔】回复3点生命。^
^Toothed Stone is immune to spells.~Toothed Stone moves one slot to~the right each turn.~Toothed Stone deals no damage to creatures.^ = ^【尖牙石】对魔法免疫。拥有者的回合~结束阶段，【尖牙石】移动到其右边的~格子。【尖牙石】不对生物造成伤害。^
^Goblin's spell^ = ^哥布林系魔法^
^Move target creature to a random~empty slot. If that creature is owned~by this spell's caster, Rescue Operation~heals 5 life to it.^ = ^【救援行动】可使目标生物移动到随机~空格处。若此生物是己方生物，它回复~5点生命。^
^Goblin^ = ^哥布林^
^Goblin Hero's attack is increased by 2~for each neighbouring creature.~Each time the opponent summons a creature~in the opposing slot, Goblin Hero moves~to a random empty slot.^ = ^邻格每有一个生物，【哥布林英雄】的~攻击+2。当对方在对格处召唤生物时，~【哥布林英雄】移动到随机空格处。^
^Each time Goblin Saboteur deals damage to~the opponent, the opponent loses the~cheapest card of a random power type.^ = ^每当【哥布林爆破者】对对方本体造成~伤害时，使对方随机一个系的最低费用~卡牌永久消失。^
^Army of Rats deals 12 damage to each~of the opponent's creatures, then deals~12 damage to a random caster's creature.^ = ^【鼠疫入侵】对对方所有生物造成12点~伤害，并对己方随机一个生物造成12点~伤害。^
^At the end of its owner's turn Portal Jumper~stuns the creature in the opposing slot,~preventing it from attacking for one turn,~then moves to a random slot.^ = ^每当拥有者的回合结束阶段，【哥布林~跃迁者】使对格生物跳过下回合的攻击~阶段，然后自身移动到随机格子处。^
^Each time any creature dies~Goblin Looter increases a random~power of its owner by 1.^ = ^当任一生物死亡时，【哥布林拾荒者】~使拥有者随机一个系的能量+1。^
^When Goblin Raider is summoned,~it puts two other Goblin Raiders~into random empty slots.^ = ^当【哥布林袭掠军】被召唤时，在随机~两个空格处各放置【哥布林袭掠军】。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn~Ratmaster deals 6 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures and decreases~a random owner's power by 3.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【御鼠大师】~对对方所有生物造成6点伤害，然后使~拥有者随机一个系的能量-3。^
^Forest creature^ = ^森林系生物^
^At the end of Mad Hermit's turn, that player~puts Magic Rabbit into a random empty slot~as a passive class ability, as long as there~is no Magic Rabbit in play.~At the beginning of its owner's turn Magic~Rabbit's attack increases by 1 permanently.^ = ^被动技能：疯狂隐士的回合结束阶段，~除非场上已经存在【魔法兔子】，否则~在随机空格处放置一只【魔法兔子】。~在拥有者的回合开始时，【魔法兔子】~的攻击+1。^
^When Crazy Squirrel is summoned~it deals 8 damage to the creature~in the opposing slot.^ = ^【疯狂松鼠】被召唤时，它对对格生物~造成8点伤害。^
^Forest Wolf must be summoned onto~Magic Rabbit. Magic Rabbit is killed.~The attack of Forest Wolf is equal~to the attack of the killed Rabbit.^ = ^【森林饿狼】需在生物【魔法兔子】上~召唤，【魔法兔子】会被杀死。【森林~饿狼】的攻击等于被杀死【魔法兔子】~的攻击。^
^When Vindictive Raccoon is summoned it~deals damage to the opponent equal to the~attack of the creature in the opposing slot.^ = ^【复仇浣熊】被召唤时，它对对方本体~造成等同于对格生物攻击的伤害。^
^When Enraged Beaver is summoned it deals~X damage to the opponent and to each of~the opponent's creatures where X~is equal to the attack of Magic Rabbit.^ = ^【暴怒海狸】被召唤时，它对对方本体~和对方所有生物造成X点伤害。其中X为~【魔法兔子】的攻击。^
^Forest spell^ = ^森林系魔法^
^Ritual of the Forest heals X+5 life~to its caster and to each of its~caster's creatures where X is~equal to the attack of Magic Rabbit.^ = ^【森林仪式】使施法者本体和己方所有~生物回复X+5点生命。X为【魔法兔子】~的攻击。^
^Treefolk Protector decreases by 3~damage dealt by the opponent's spells.^ = ^【古木守护者】使对方魔法造成的所有~伤害-3。^
^When Bee Queen is summoned it puts~a 2/8 Bee Soldier into each of its empty~neighbouring slots. When Bee Queen or~a Bee Soldier dies it deals 3 damage~to the opponent.^ = ^当【蜂后】被召唤时，它在相邻空格处~放置数值为2/8的【兵蜂】。【蜂后】~或【兵蜂】死亡时，它对对方本体造成~3点伤害。^
^Each time Angry Angry Bear~receives damage its attack~increases by 1 permanently.^ = ^每当【暴怒熊】受到任何伤害时，它的~攻击永久+1。^
^When Bee Soldier dies~it deals 3 damage to opponent.^ = ^当【兵蜂】死亡时，它对对方本体造成~3点伤害。^
^Time creature^ = ^时间系生物^
^Each time Chrono Hunter kills~an opponent's creature it increases~its owner's Time power by 2.^ = ^【时空猎人】杀死对方的任一生物时，~它使拥有者的时间系能量+2。^
^When Timeblazer is summoned each of~its neighbouring creatures attack~the opponent this turn instead~of the creature in the opposing slot.^ = ^当【时间闪击者】被召唤时，邻格生物~在本回合的攻击阶段内会攻击对方本体~而非对格生物。^
^Time spell^ = ^时间系魔法^
^Target caster's creature with attack 9~or less immediately attacks the opponent~and all the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【加速】可以使己方的目标生物（攻击~不超过9）立即对对方本体和对方所有~生物进行一次攻击。^
^Time Stop deals 4 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures and forces~the opponent to skip their next turn.^ = ^【时间停止】对对方所有生物造成4点~伤害，并使对方失去下一个出牌阶段。^
^When Timeweaver is summoned its owner~is able to cast an additional spell this~turn. Timeweaver decreases the cost of~its owner's spells by 1.^ = ^【时间编织者】被召唤时，拥有者可以~立即获得额外一个只能施放魔法的出牌~阶段。【时间编织者】使得拥有者所有~魔法卡牌的费用-1。^
^Priestess of Moments performs an additional~attack in each of its owner's turns,~and allows its owner's other creatures~to attack the turn they enter play.^ = ^拥有者的生物攻击阶段，【瞬时祭司】~进行额外一次攻击。【瞬时祭司】使得~拥有者的其它生物可以在上场的回合内~就进行攻击。^
^Chrono Engine allows its owner to use~an additional card each turn. Each time~its owner skips a turn Chrono Engine~increases its owner's Time power by 1.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始时，【时空引擎】~使拥有者获得额外的一个出牌的阶段。~每当拥有者选择跳轮时，【时空引擎】~使拥有者的时间系能量+1。^
^When Time Dragon is summoned~its owner may use an additional~card this turn. Time Dragon attacks~the turn it enters play.^ = ^当【时间之龙】被召唤时，拥有者可以~立即获得额外的一个出牌阶段。【时间~之龙】可在被召唤的回合内进行攻击。^
^At the beginning of its owners turn,~Goblin Berserker deals 1 damage~to its neighboring creatures.^ = ^每当拥有者的回合开始阶段，【哥布林~狂战士】对邻格生物造成1点伤害。^
^Deals 1 less damage~to neighboring creatures^ = ^对邻格生物造成的伤害~减少1点^
^Deals 2 damage to the opponent each turn^ = ^每回合对对方本体造成2点伤害^
^Deals 2 damage to the opponent~each turn^ = ^每回合对对方本体~造成2点伤害^
^+2 life^ = ^生命+2^
^+1 Attack^ = ^攻击+1^
^Deals 3 damage to opponent^ = ^对对方本体造成3点伤害^
^Deals 3 damage to opponent~as additional effect^ = ^额外对对方本体~造成3点伤害^
^Bargul's attack is increased~by 1 each turn^ = ^每回合【霸古魔】的攻击+1^
^Attack 7, increases~by 1 each turn^ = ^初始攻击为7，~每回合攻击+1^
^Inferno deals 22 damage to target~opponent's creature and 10 damage to~each of the opponent's other creatures.^ = ^【炼狱爆轰】可以对目标生物造成22点~伤害，并对对方所有其它生物造成10点~伤害。^
^Deals 4 additional damage~to main target^ = ^对目标生物~多造成4点伤害^
^When Fire Elemental is summoned~it deals 4 damage to the opponent~and to each of the opponent's creatures.~Fire Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Fire power by 1.^ = ^当【火元素】被召唤时，它对对方本体~和对方的所有生物造成4点伤害。此外~它使拥有者的火系能量成长率+1。^
^+1 damage when is summoned^ = ^被召唤时造成的伤害+1^
^Reduces the opponent's Earth power by 2^ = ^使对方的土系能量-2^
^Reduces the opponent's Earth power~by 2 as additional effect^ = ^额外使对方的~土系能量-2^
^Heals 2 life to its caster^ = ^使拥有者回复2点生命^
^Heals 2 life to its caster~as additional effect^ = ^额外使拥有者~回复2点生命^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Sea Sprite deals 2 damage to the opponent.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始阶段，【海妖】对~对方本体造成2点伤害。^
^Attack is reduced by 3,~deals damage to the opponent~instead of its owner each turn.^ = ^攻击-3。之后每回合~对拥有者本体造成伤害改为~对对方本体造成伤害^
^Heals 2 life to self each time~owner cast any spell^ = ^拥有者施放魔法时，【寒冰傀儡】~回复2点生命^
^Reduces by 1 cost of all~its owner's water cards^ = ^使拥有者所有的~水系卡牌费用-1^
^Acidic Rain deals 17 damage~to each creature, then decreases~each of the opponent's powers by 1.^ = ^【酸雨术】对所有生物造成17点伤害，~然后使对方的各系能量-1。^
^Deals 2 more damage^ = ^多造成2点伤害^
^When Water Elemental is summoned~it heals 12 life to its owner.~Water Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Water power by 1.^ = ^【水元素】被召唤时，它使拥有者回复~12点生命。【水元素】使拥有者的水系~能量成长率+1。^
^Heals 2 additional life^ = ^多回复2点生命^
^+3 Attack^ = ^攻击+3^
^Call to Thunder deals 7 damage~to target opponent's creature~and 7 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【落雷术】对对方目标生物和对方本体~造成7点伤害。^
^Deals 1 more damage^ = ^多造成1点伤害^
^+4 life^ = ^生命+4^
^Deals 2 damage to the opponent's creatures^ = ^对对方所有生物造成2点伤害^
^Deals 2 damage to the opponent's~creatures as additional effect^ = ^额外对对方所有生物~造成2点伤害^
^Each time Phoenix dies~if its owner's Fire power is 10 or greater~Phoenix rebirth and deals~3 damage to the opponent.^ = ^当【凤凰】死亡时，如果拥有者的火系~能量不少于10，它会重生（【凤凰】会~放置在同一格里），并对对方本体造成~3点伤害。如果【凤凰】是被一张卡牌~“摧毁”，则它不会重生。^
^Deals 3 damage to the opponent~each time when rebirth.^ = ^每次重生时对对方本体~造成3点伤害^
^Chain Lightning deals 10 damage~to the opponent and to each~of the opponent's creatures.^ = ^【连锁闪电】对对方本体和对方的所有~生物造成10点伤害。^
^Reduces opponent's air power by 1^ = ^使对方的气系能量-1^
^Reduces opponent's air power~by 1 as additional effect^ = ^额外使对方的~气系能量-1^
^When Air Elemental is summoned~it deals 10 damage to the opponent.~Air Elemental increases the growth~of its owner's Air power by 1.^ = ^当【气元素】被召唤时，它对对方本体~造成10点伤害。【气元素】使拥有者的~气系能量成长率+1。^
^Deals 2 more damage~when is summoned^ = ^在被召唤时~多造成2点伤害^
^When Titan is summoned~it deals 20 damage to the creature~in the opposing slot.^ = ^【泰坦巨人】被召唤时，它对对格生物~造成20点伤害。^
^Deals 5 more damage~when is summoned^ = ^在被召唤时~多造成5点伤害^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Elvish Healer heals 4 life to its owner.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始阶段，【精灵医者】~使拥有者本体回复4点生命。^
^Heals 1 more life each turn^ = ^每回合多回复1点生命^
^Nature's Ritual heals 9 life~to target caster's creature~and to its caster.^ = ^【自然仪式】使己方目标生物和施法者~本体各回复9点生命。^
^Heals 1 more life^ = ^多回复1点生命^
^Heals 2 life to each caster's creature^ = ^使己方所有生物回复2点生命^
^Heals 2 life to each caster's~creature as additional effect^ = ^额外使己方所有生物~回复2点生命^
^Deals 3 damage~to blocked opponent's creatures^ = ^对对方所有被阻挡的生物~造成3点伤害^
^Deals 3 damage to blocked~opponent's creatures as additional effect^ = ^额外对对方所有被阻挡的生物~造成3点伤害^
^+3 life^ = ^生命+3^
^Receives +2 Attack when unblocked^ = ^当【巨魔】未被阻挡时，它的攻击+2^
^Receives +2 Attack~when unblocked^ = ^未被阻挡时~攻击+2^
^Reduces opponent's air power by 2^ = ^使对方的气系能量-2^
^Reduces opponent's air power~by 2 as additional effect^ = ^额外使对方的~气系能量-2^
^Hydra's attack damages the opponent~and each of the opponent's creatures.~At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Hydra heals 5 life to itself.^ = ^【九头蛇】的攻击会对对方本体和对方~的所有生物造成伤害。在拥有者的回合~开始阶段，【九头蛇】回复5点生命。^
^Regenerates 1 more life each turn^ = ^每回合多回复1点生命^
^When Crusader is summoned it heals~2 life to each of its owner's creatures.^ = ^当【十字军】被召唤时，它使己方所有~生物回复2点生命。^
^Each time a neighboring creature dies,~Holy Avenger's attack increases~by 2 permanently.^ = ^任一邻格生物死亡时，【神圣复仇者】~的攻击永久+2。^
^Each time its owner summons a creature~into a neighboring slot, Templar deals~4 damage to the opponent.^ = ^每当拥有者在其邻格召唤任一生物时，~【圣堂骑士】对对方本体造成4点伤害。^
^Divine Meddling increases its caster's~Fire, Water, Air and Earth powers by 2,~then deals 10 damage to the opponent.^ = ^【神圣压制】使施法者的火系、水系、~气系和土系能量各+2，然后对对方本体~造成10点伤害。^
^Rage of God deals 12 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures, then deals~3 damage to the opponent for each of~the opponent's creatures that did not die.^ = ^【神之怒火】对对方所有生物造成12点~伤害，并对对方本体造成X×3的伤害。~其中X为此魔法未杀死的对方生物数量。^
^When Angel of War is summoned~it deals 8 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures and heals~8 life to each of its owner's creatures.^ = ^【战争天使】被召唤时，它对对方所有~生物造成8点伤害，并使己方所有生物~回复8点生命。^
^Blood spell^ = ^鲜血系魔法^
^and^ = ^自损^
^life`2^ = ^生命^
^Blood Boil deals 4 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures, then increases~its owner's Blood power by 1 for each~creature killed by this spell.^ = ^【鲜血沸腾】对对方所有生物造成4点~伤害，然后使施法者的鲜血系能量+X。~其中X为此魔法杀死的对方生物数量。^
^Blood creature^ = ^鲜血系生物^
^blood`2^ = ^^
^Each time an opponent's creature dies~Ghoul's attack increases by 1 permanently.^ = ^对方的任一生物死亡时，【食尸鬼】的~攻击永久+1。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Devoted Servant's attack increases by 1~permanently. When Devoted Servant dies~it increases its owner's Blood power~by an amount equal to its attack.^ = ^拥有者的回合开始时，【血之从者】的~攻击永久+1。当【血之从者】死亡时，~它使拥有者增加等同于其攻击的鲜血系~能量。^
^Each time the opponent receives~damage, Vampire Mystic's attack~increases by 2 until end of turn.^ = ^每当对方本体受到任一伤害时，【血之~秘术师】的攻击+2。此攻击加成在回合~结束时消失。^
^The opposing creature receives double~damage from all sources.~While Justicar is unblocked all damage~done to the opponent is increased by 2.^ = ^【审判者】可以使对格生物受到的所有~伤害×2。当【审判者】未被阻挡时，~己方对对方本体造成的任何伤害均+2。^
^Each time its owner receives damage~Chastiser's attack increases by 2~until after its next attack.^ = ^每当拥有者本体受到任一伤害时，会使~【惩戒者】的攻击+2。此加成在它进行~下一次攻击后消失。^
^When Vampire Elder is summoned it puts~a 5/14 Initiate into each of its empty~neighboring slots. While Vampire Elder~is in play Initiates receive no damage.^ = ^当【吸血鬼长老】被召唤时，它在相邻~空格处放置数值为5/14的【仆从】。当~【吸血鬼长老】在场时，【仆从】不会~受到任何伤害。^
^When Magister of Blood is summoned it~deals 16 damage to the opponent and to~each of the opponent's blocked creatures.^ = ^当【血魔导师】被召唤时，它会对对方~本体和对方所有被阻挡的生物造成16点~伤害。^
^While Vampire Elder is in play~Initiates receive no damage.^ = ^【吸血鬼长老】在场时，【仆从】不会~受到任何伤害。^
^Cult creature^ = ^膜拜系生物^
^Fanatic receives double damage~from the opponent's spells.^ = ^对方施放的魔法对【狂热信徒】造成的~任何伤害均×2。^
^Cult spell^ = ^膜拜系魔法^
^Call to Ancient Spirits deals 10 damage~to each of the opponent's creatures,~then deals 5 damage to each of its~caster's creatures.^ = ^【灵魂之召】对对方所有生物造成10点~伤害，对己方所有生物造成5点伤害。^
^At the beginning of its owner's turn,~Zealot's attack increases by 2 permanently.~Each time Zealot deals damage~it loses an equal amount of life.^ = ^在拥有者的回合开始时，【狂热死士】~的攻击永久+2。每当【狂热死士】造成~一次伤害时，它失去等量的生命。^
^Owner's creatures perform~an additional attack each turn.~Each time an owner's creature deal~damage by attacking, Monument to Rage~loses an equal amount of life.^ = ^拥有者的生物攻击阶段，己方所有生物~进行额外一次攻击。当己方生物的攻击~造成伤害时，【狂怒纪念碑】将会失去~等量的生命。^
^While Cursed Unicorn is blocked, it~lose 5 life each turn but all spell damage~done to Cursed Unicorn is redirected~to the opposite creature.^ = ^以下效果只在【邪恶独角兽】被阻挡时~触发：每次在拥有者的回合开始阶段，~【邪恶独角兽】损失5点生命；所有对~【邪恶独角兽】造成的魔法伤害都重新~定向至对格生物。^
^Blind Prophet increases the growth of its~owner's Fire, Water, Air and Earth powers~by 1 and decreases the growth of its~owner's Worship power by 1.^ = ^【目盲先知】使拥有者的火系、水系、~气系和土系能量成长率各+1，同时会使~拥有者的膜拜系能量成长率-1。^
^All damage that would be dealt to~its owner's other creatures is redirected~to Reaver instead. While Reaver is in play,~its owner can't cast spells.^ = ^所有对己方生物造成的伤害都重新定向~至【掠夺者】。当【掠夺者】在场时，~拥有者不能施放魔法。^
^When Greater Bargul is summoned it~deals 20 damage to each other creature.~At the beginning of its owner's turn~Greater Bargul deals 3 damage to its owner.^ = ^【霸古魔王】被召唤时，它对所有其它~生物造成20点伤害。拥有者的回合开始~阶段，【霸古魔王】对拥有者本体造成~3点伤害。^
^Creature^ = ^生物^
^Golem receives no damage from spells and~abilities. When Golem dies Golem is put~into another random empty slot~(with full life) and its owner loses 10 life.^ = ^【魔像】不会受任何魔法或技能造成的~伤害。【魔像】被杀死时，立即在随机~空格处放置新的【魔像】，同时拥有者~本体失去10点生命。^
^Golem spell^ = ^技艺系魔法^
^Golem's Frenzy deals 3 damage to each of~the opponent's creatures. For each creature~killed by this spell, Golem's attack~is increased by 3 until end of turn.^ = ^【魔像之忿】对对方所有生物造成3点~伤害，并使【魔像】增加等同于此魔法~杀死生物数量×3的攻击。此攻击加成~在回合结束时消失。^
^Golem creature^ = ^技艺系生物^
^Guardian Statue receives no damage~until it performs its first attack.^ = ^【守护石像】不会受任何伤害。此效果~在它进行第一次攻击后消失。^
^Golem's Justice deals 4 damage~to each of the opponent's creatures,~then heals 4 life to Golem's neighbours.^ = ^【魔像之审判】对对方的所有生物造成~4点伤害，然后使【魔像】的邻格生物~回复4点生命。^
^Army Upgrade heals 3 life to each of~its caster's creatures. Golem's attack is~increased by 2 permanently; this bonus~remains even after Golem is killed.^ = ^【军备升级】使己方所有生物回复3点~生命，【魔像】的攻击永久+2。此攻击~加成在【魔像】被杀死后仍会保留。^
^attack is equal~to number of owner's creatures^ = ^攻击等于拥有者~的生物数量^
^Golem Instructor increases~Golem's attack by 2.^ = ^【魔像操纵师】使【魔像】的攻击+2。^
^When Dark Sculptor is summoned~it deals X damage to each of the~opponent's creatures, where X is equal~to the number of creatures in play.^ = ^当【暗黑雕刻家】被召唤时，他可以对~对方所有生物造成等同于场上生物数量~的伤害。^
^When Golem Guide is summoned it swaps~positions with Golem and increases~Golem's attack by 3 until end of turn.^ = ^当【魔像引导者】被召唤时，他可以和~【魔像】交换位置，同时使【魔像】的~攻击+3。此加成在回合结束时消失。^
^While Golem Handler is in play,~Golem performs an additional attack~during each of its owner's turns.^ = ^在拥有者的生物攻击阶段，如果【魔像~掌控者】在场，【魔像】进行额外一次~攻击。^
^Gives to owner 1 life~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时生命+1^
^Gives to owner 2 life~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时生命+2^
^Gives to owner 3 life~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时生命+3^
^Gives to owner 4 life~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时生命+4^
^Gives to owner 5 life~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时生命+5^
^Gives to owner 1 fire power~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时火系能量+1^
^Gives to owner 1 water power~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时水系能量+1^
^Gives to owner 1 air power~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时气系能量+1^
^Gives to owner 1 earth power~at the beginning of each duel.^ = ^使拥有者在对战开始时土系能量+1^
^Allows player to start each duel~with tamed griffin fighting~at player's side.^ = ^使玩家在对战开始时~在场上拥有【驯化的狮鹫】^
^Increases attack of players's griffin by 1.~Increases life of players's griffin by 2.^ = ^使狮鹫的攻击+1、生命+2^
^Increases attack of players's pet by 1.^ = ^使玩家的狮鹫攻击+1^
