^Allows player to resurect pet~if it dies during combat.~Allows player to move pet at the field.^ = ^使玩家可以在狮鹫死亡后重新召唤它。~玩家可以移动场上的狮鹫。^
^Each time your pet is resummoned~it deals 6 damage to creature~in the opposite slot^ = ^当玩家的狮鹫被重新召唤时，~狮鹫对对格生物造成6点伤害^
