^Welcome to the League of Heroes!~It is a group of mages nearly equal in~skill. They are constantly competing~in tournaments and the winner~advances to a higher league.~Good luck on your way to victory!^ = ^欢迎来到英雄联盟！~这里有一群实力相近的英雄。~他们互相之间进行比赛，~获胜者能够进入更高级别的联赛。~祝您在胜利的路上能遇上好运气！^
