^- Duels with customized decks!^ = ^- 使用自定义牌组对战！^
^- Draft tournaments versus human and AI opponents.^ = ^- 自选卡牌锦标赛面对人类对手和人工智能对手。^
^- Ability to observe the online duels of other players.^ = ^- 在线观看其他玩家对战。^
^Buy the full game to access all the features^ = ^购买完整版游戏来访问游戏里的所有功能，^
^of Spectromancer, including:^ = ^包括了：^
