^Elemental powers for both players~grow 3 each turn. When any player~plays a card, the power type of that~card is set to 0 for both players.^ = ^对战双方的基础系能量成长率均为3。~当一位玩家使用一张卡牌时，双方与~此卡牌同系的能量降至0。^
^Izenhart^ = ^伊森哈特^
^Whenever a player uses a card~his cards of that power type~are replaced by random cards.^ = ^当任一玩家使用一张卡牌时，他所有~同系卡牌被随机卡牌所替代。^
^Olgerd^ = ^奥尔加德^
^Each player will start~the duel with 40 life.^ = ^在对战开始时，双方生命均为40。^
^Tiberius^ = ^泰比利斯^
^At the beginning of each turn~a random creature of the acting~player takes 4 damage.^ = ^在每个玩家的回合开始时，他的随机~一个生物受到4点伤害。^
^Kobrin^ = ^卡布瑞恩^
^Each time a player uses a card~his opponent gains 1 power~of that card's type.^ = ^每当任一玩家使用一张卡牌时，他的~对手获得1点与此卡牌同系的能量。^
^Batalus^ = ^巴特拉斯^
^Istran^ = ^伊斯坦恩^
^Amehet^ = ^阿姆哈特^
^Laerdana^ = ^拉尔丹娜^
^A player may not reuse a particular~card until all cards of that~power type have been used.^ = ^任一玩家不能再次使用同一张卡牌，~直到同系的所有卡牌都使用过为止。^
^Dimorph^ = ^迪莫夫^
^All creatures will attack the turn~they come into play.^ = ^所有生物在上场的回合内就可攻击。^
^Stonegor^ = ^斯通格尔^
^Grunvald^ = ^格朗拉德^
^Critana^ = ^魁塔纳^
^When a player skips his turn~he gains 3 power of a random type.^ = ^当任一玩家跳轮时，他随机一个系的~能量+3。^
^A player cannot have more than~12 power of any type.^ = ^对战双方的各系能量都不会超过12。^
^Egbert^ = ^伊格波特^
^Each time either player uses a card,~on the following turn his opponent~cannot use a card of the same power type.^ = ^任一玩家使用一张卡牌后，他的对手~在下回合不能使用同一系的卡牌。^
^Kaltor^ = ^卡尔特^
^Futark^ = ^弗塔克^
^Zukrilla^ = ^祖科瑞拉^
^Estarh^ = ^伊斯塔^
^Each turn all of the acting player's cards~will be replaced by random cards.^ = ^每回合当前玩家所有卡牌都会被随机~卡牌所替代。^
^Whenever a player uses a card,~on the following turn he~will be unable to use cards~of the neighboring power types.^ = ^任一玩家使用一张卡牌后，他下回合~将不能使用与此卡牌左右相邻系别的~所有卡牌。^
^Radivil^ = ^拉德维尔^
^Each time any player summons~a creature that creature deals 4 damage~to each creature of same power.^ = ^任一玩家召唤一个生物时，此生物对~场上所有其它同系生物造成4点伤害。^
^Dunstan^ = ^杜斯坦^
^Each time a player uses a card~with cost 9 or more~that player gains 5 life.^ = ^每当任一玩家使用一张费用不少于9的~卡牌时，他回复5点生命。^
^Umkazi^ = ^乌姆卡兹^
^Each time any player uses a card,~his opponent loses 1 power~of that card's type.^ = ^每当任一玩家使用一张卡牌时，他的~对手失去1点与此卡牌同系的能量。^
^Merigar^ = ^莫里加^
^Each player has one locked slot,~and is unable summon creatures into it.~This slot moves randomly each turn.^ = ^每一个玩家都有一个被锁定的空格。~他不能在此空格上召唤生物。这空格~在回合结束的时候会随机移动。^
^Online1^ = ^在线1^
^Each time a player uses a card~that player loses all remaining~power of the type spent.^ = ^当一个玩家使用一张卡牌时，他失去~与此卡牌同系的所有剩余能量。^
^Online2^ = ^在线2^
^Each time any creature attacks empty slot~it receives +1 to attack permanently.~Forest sprite, Hydra, Lightning Cloud~and Three-headed demon are~unaffected by this rule.^ = ^任一生物攻击一个空格时，它的攻击~永久+1。【森林仙子】、【九头蛇】、~【雷电云】和【三首恶魔】不受此规则~影响。^
^Mirror^ = ^镜像^
^Each player will start the duel with~equal Fire, Water, Air and Earth cards~and with equal powers.^ = ^对战开始时，双方拥有相同的火系、~水系、气系和土系的卡牌，并且拥有~相同的初始能量。^
^Online4^ = ^在线4^
^Each player starts duel with 120 life.~Each time a player uses a card~that player receives damage~equal to cost of this card.^ = ^对战开始时，双方的生命为120。每当~任一玩家使用一张卡牌时，他会受到~等同于此卡牌费用的伤害。^
