^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to be able to customize your random class.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来自定义随机职业。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to continue playing League of Heroes.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来继续英雄联盟。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to play tournaments as a spectromancer.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来作为虹光法师进行锦标赛游戏。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to observe duels.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来观看对战。^
^You must purchase the game to propose blitz duels.^ = ^您必须购买游戏来解锁快速游戏。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to propose blitz duels.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来解锁快速游戏。^
^You should win at least one single duel~to gain access to the Campaign.^ = ^您必须至少赢得一次单局对战才能访问战役。^
^You should win at least one single duel~to gain access to the League of Heroes.^ = ^您必须至少赢得一次单局对战才能访问联盟。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to customize a deck.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来自定义卡牌。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to play in draft tournaments.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来进行自选卡牌锦标赛。^
^You must purchase the Gathering of Power expansion~to view replays.^ = ^您必须购买风云际会扩展包~来观看回放。^
